    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110">

                <pb facs="0204" n="162" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg162"/>

                <head>Mr. Adams to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 343.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-03-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 6, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Deeming it no more than proper to
                    acknowledge Lord Russell’s note to me of the 28th ultimo, a copy of which was
                    sent with my despatch No. 338 of last week, I now submit a copy of my reply.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d110-a1.xml" xpointer="d110-a1"/>
            </div>
